Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 08:12:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 4: faster thumbnails and reliable live refresh

- Load grid thumbnails via ContentResolver.loadThumbnail (system thumbnail cache)
- Cache total count per PagingSource instead of counting on every page load
- Observe images/video tables (not just files) and add a generation-based refresh on resume
- Sign release builds with the debug key for local performance testing
